Package: agent-sphere
Version: 0.1.0-2
Architecture: all
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: MoteBus Engineering <engineering@ypcloud.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/motebus/agent-sphere-deb
Depends: sphered (>= 4.1.0-2), moted (>= 3.5.0-8), mote-proxy (>= 2.0.0-5), mote-transportd (>= 2.0.0-5), medge (>= 2.0.0-2), mlink (>= 2.0.0-3)
Description: Agent Computer system substrate composition
 Composes the independent MoteBus/DC foundation, Host Mote Endpoint,
 Mote Access Endpoint, D/MSG runtime, Agentic Edge runtime, and Local I/O.
 APT and DPKG resolve dependencies; component packages own systemd lifecycle.
 Agent intelligence and applications are distributed separately.
 This initial composition release does not certify Sphere Ready.
